@anon.53fe85e3a453dfbf0ab1e8743506e67c.1194 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [600 x i8] }> <{ [600 x i8] c"How to determine line breaks.\0A\0AWhen this property is set to `{auto}`, its default value, optimized line\0Abreaks will be used for justified paragraphs. Enabling optimized line\0Abreaks for ragged paragraphs may also be worthwhile to improve the\0Aappearance of the text.\0A\0A```example\0A#set page(width: 207pt)\0A#set par(linebreaks: \22simple\22)\0ASome texts feature many longer\0Awords. Those are often exceedingly\0Achallenging to break in a visually\0Apleasing way.\0A\0A#set par(linebreaks: \22optimized\22)\0ASome texts feature many longer\0Awords. Those are often exceedingly\0Achallenging to break in a visually\0Apleasing way.\0A```" }>, align 1
